Linux Wayland window decorations
-------------------------------
sctk-adwaita 0.10.1 (https://github.com/PolyMeilex/sctk-adwaita,
commit d5f343c45c04d4a026db57f76760819b7325db00) is used by winit on Linux
for Adwaita window decorations. Its unmodified fallback title font is
src/title/Cantarell-Regular.ttf (SIL OFL 1.1), embedded by the dependency;
no font file is copied into this repository. Window button icons are drawn
as vector paths and do not use the title font.

